Get started:

  1. For the user: use your HyperFrames plugin, or install standalone skills with:
     npx hyperframes skills update

  2. Open this project with your AI coding agent:
     cd scaffold/hyperframes-report then start Claude Code, Cursor, or your preferred agent

  3. Try a starter prompt:
     "Using /hyperframes, create a 15-second intro about [your topic]"
     More patterns: https://hyperframes.heygen.com/prompting/overview?utm_source=cli

  4. Preview in the browser:
     cd scaffold/hyperframes-report && npm run dev

  5. Check the composition:
     cd scaffold/hyperframes-report && npm run check

  6. Render to MP4 when ready:
     cd scaffold/hyperframes-report && npm run render

  Full docs: https://hyperframes.heygen.com/?utm_source=cli
